          "source_text": "IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.\nPROGRAM-ID. BRANCH-RULE.\nDATA DIVISION.\nWORKING-STORAGE SECTION.\n01 IN-AMOUNT PIC S99.\n01 OUT-AMOUNT PIC S999.\nPROCEDURE DIVISION.\nMAIN.\nIF IN-AMOUNT > ZERO\nCOMPUTE OUT-AMOUNT = IN-AMOUNT * 2\nELSE\nCOMPUTE OUT-AMOUNT = IN-AMOUNT * 3\nEND-IF.\nGOBACK.",
          "span_truncated": false,
          "evidence_id": "ev_page_30a76d5dee7307a67175af1a",
          "source_characters": 272,
