          ],
          "source_statement_role_scope": "indexed_statement_syntax_candidate",
          "flow_execution_verified": false
        }
      ],
      "fixed_response": "在 IN-AMOUNT > ZERO 的条件下，OUT-AMOUNT = IN-AMOUNT * 3；否则 OUT-AMOUNT = IN-AMOUNT * 2。[ev_page_30a76d5dee7307a67175af1a]",
      "request_bytes": 34127
    }
  ],
  "answer": "已供应源码可直接确认：在源码控制条件 `IF IN-AMOUNT > ZERO` 下，`OUT-AMOUNT = IN-AMOUNT * 2`（rule.cbl:10）[ev_page_30a76d5dee7307a67175af1a]；`IF IN-AMOUNT > ZERO`（rule.cbl:9）[ev_page_30a76d5dee7307a67175af1a]。已供应源码可直接确认：在源码控制条件 `条件不成立：IF IN-AMOUNT > ZERO` 下，`OUT-AMOUNT = IN-AMOUNT * 3`（rule.cbl:12）[ev_page_30a76d5dee7307a67175af1a]。",
